"This section is drawn by code. What you write below is added to it — unless "
"you say it replaces it."
msgstr ""
"Cette section est dessinée par du code. Ce que vous écrivez ci-dessous s’y "
"ajoute — sauf si vous dites qu’il la remplace."

#: includes/admin-account.php:500
msgid "Your content"
msgstr "Votre contenu"

#: includes/admin-account.php:516
msgid ""
"Text, HTML, or the shortcode of another plugin. Leave it empty and the "
"section stays as the plugin draws it."
msgstr ""
"Du texte, du HTML, ou le code court d’une autre extension. Laissez vide et "
"la section reste telle que l’extension la dessine."

#: includes/admin-account.php:517
msgid ""
"Text, HTML, or the shortcode of another plugin — a course plugin, a "
"membership, a support desk. This is the whole section."
msgstr ""
"Du texte, du HTML, ou le code court d’une autre extension — une extension de"
" cours, un abonnement, un support. C’est toute la section."

#: includes/admin-account.php:525
msgid "Comes from"
msgstr "Vient de"

#: includes/admin-account.php:529
msgid ""
"It comes from code, so it cannot be deleted —the code that draws it is still"
" there and it would come back— but it can be hidden."
msgstr ""
"Elle vient du code : elle ne peut donc pas être supprimée —le code qui la "
"dessine est toujours là et elle reviendrait— mais elle peut être masquée."

#: includes/admin-account.php:536
msgid "Save section"
msgstr "Enregistrer la section"

#: includes/admin-account.php:543
