#: includes/admin-appearance.php:49 includes/admin.php:74
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Apparence"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:68
msgid ""
"Everything the plugin draws —panels, forms, lists, buttons— takes its "
"colours and its corners from a handful of CSS properties. Change those two "
"below and everything follows; a site with its own design can point them at "
"its own tokens from its stylesheet, without copying anything from here."
msgstr ""
"Tout ce que l’extension dessine —panneaux, formulaires, listes, boutons— "
"tire ses couleurs et ses coins d’une poignée de propriétés CSS. Changez ces "
"deux-là ci-dessous et le reste suit ; un site qui a son propre design peut "
"les pointer vers ses propres jetons depuis sa feuille de style, sans rien "
"copier d’ici."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:76
msgid "Load the plugin stylesheet"
msgstr "Charger la feuille de style de l’extension"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:78
msgid ""
"Only turn it off if the site is going to style every diluxone-users-* class "
"itself. Turned off, its panels and buttons come out bare and the site has to"
" draw them; re-pointing the properties is almost always enough, and it "
"survives the plugin adding a new component."
msgstr ""
"Ne la désactivez que si le site va styler lui-même chaque classe diluxone-"
"users-*. Désactivée, ses panneaux et ses boutons sortent nus et c’est au "
"site de les dessiner ; repointer les propriétés suffit presque toujours, et "
"cela survit à l’ajout d’un nouveau composant."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:83
msgid "Dark mode"
msgstr "Mode sombre"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:85
msgid ""
"There is none here, on purpose. Dark mode belongs to the site: a light site "
"seen from a dark system used to end up with a light page and black panels. "
"If the site has a dark mode, its own tokens change and these follow."
msgstr ""
"Il n’y en a pas ici, volontairement. Le mode sombre appartient au site : un "
"site clair vu depuis un système sombre se retrouvait avec une page claire et"
" des panneaux noirs. Si le site a un mode sombre, ses propres jetons "
"changent et ceux-ci suivent."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:89
msgid "Accent colour"
msgstr "Couleur d’accent"

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:92
msgid "Buttons, the open tab, links and the drawn avatars."
msgstr "Les boutons, l’onglet ouvert, les liens et les avatars dessinés."

#: includes/admin-appearance.php:96
msgid "Corners"
